{#- Official TypeScript per-table template (design §22 G2).
    Registered under the target's `file_template` name (default
    `{table}.ts`), rendered once per table in name order. Decisions are
    precomputed in context: `header_what`, `import_line` (type-only enums
    import), `description`/`banner`, `ident`, `interface_empty`,
    `members` (name order — prop/optional marker/Local-style type/doc),
    `defaults_empty`, `default_rows`, and the inlined `factory_inline`
    expression. -#}// <auto-generated>
